{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1109402-chicago-by-night-time-gone-by-recruitment","id":1109402,"title":"Chicago By Night: Time Gone By recruitment","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-29T14:37:08-07:00","id":1109402,"title":"Chicago By Night: Time Gone By recruitment","content":"In 1993, the Camarilla Prince of Lodin was torn to shreds, one of the many victims of a combined Sabbat/Black Spiral Dancer assault on the Kindred of Chicago, Illinois. The city was left with multiple contenders vying for control of the city and the title of Prince, while Elders weaved intrigues in Elysium and Anarchs railed against the inequities of their youth, weak blood, and a system that was designed to keep them down. All the while, two Methuselahs waged a shadow-war with Kindred and mortal proxies alike, seeking to slate a millennium-old thirst for vengeance over the death of a dream.<br /> <br /> Nearly twenty-five years later, join us, and peel back the mystery of how the immortal nights of Chicago have changed. We are currently accepting applications for Chicago By Night: Time Gone By, a play-by-post game using the Vampire the Masquerade 20<sup>th</sup> edition rule-set, set in the early months of 2017 and onward.<br /> <br /> Character Creation<br /> General Restrictions: Characters are assumed to be Neonates/Ancillae no more than 50 years old as a Kindred, and with little experience in Chicago (newcomers or young neonates). 8<sup>th</sup> Generation is lowest starting player generation.<br /> Clan Choices: All Camarilla (Assamites [Clan Weakness will be per VTM Revised, rather than VTM 20], Brujah, Gangrel, Giovanni, Malkavian, Nosferatu, Toreador, Tremere, Ventrue), Caitiff, Lasombra. Anything else is unlikely to be considered without a truly amazing character background/concept.<br /> Attributes 7/5/4<br /> Abilities 13/9/6<br /> Backgrounds 5<br /> Virtues 7<br /> Freebie Points 21<br /> Merits and Flaws Up to 7 points<br /> Concept/Background \u2013 We\u2019d like at least a page or so worth of character background so we can really get a feel for the character and work in some plot hooks to help tie the character into the setting better. We\u2019re aiming for this to be a long-term game, which is something we're very much used to.<br /> <br /> We welcome submissions, as well as any questions regarding character creation, either via PM here or at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e8828985898f8d8da88e9d84849b898184c68d8c9d\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"85efe4e8e4e2e0e0c5e3f0e9e9f6e4ece9abe0e1f0\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> The game will be played via discussion board (ZetaBoards to start, as we work on a permanent board on our own web domain).<br /> <br /> With regards to our backgrounds as Storytellers, I (the game designer) have been running VTM games since 1992 when I got the first edition book, and had started playing RPG games about five years previous. My partner (the web designer) got her start on online RPGs, especially super-powered ones, in the early Aughts, and our last online play by post project that we ran together ended up running for 18,000+ posts, 8 years and had, at it's apogee, over 30 players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13636-blackaeon","name":"blackaeon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13636_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T00:20:35-07:00","id":1110087,"title":"","content":"Hey, looking forward to join if I may know what's the link to the forum, thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13599-revelation","name":"Revelation","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T08:17:32-07:00","id":1110168,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Revelation</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1109402-chicago-by-night-time-gone-by-recruitment?p=1110087#post1110087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, looking forward to join if I may know what's the link to the forum, thanks.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The forum isn't up yet (my partner's the web designer, I'm a game designer by degree!) which is why I'm accepting apps and working with people on sheets beforehand. I'm doing a lot of data entry on a base site that we'll use initially while she sets the other one up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13636-blackaeon","name":"blackaeon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13636_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T19:52:06-07:00","id":1112466,"title":"","content":"We're going to be wrapping recruitment for the game as of 7/14/17; we've already gotten a few people from this site, and a few from others, and things are shaping up to be pretty interesting!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13636-blackaeon","name":"blackaeon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13636_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T07:10:05-07:00","id":1115935,"title":"","content":"I'd be interested in this if you'd have me!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5036-ambersand","name":"Ambersand","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T09:39:57-07:00","id":1115987,"title":"","content":"At this point, we've extended the submission final date until Sunday, the 16th, as I got really sick this week. Feel free to send a bio and sheet!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13636-blackaeon","name":"blackaeon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13636_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}